		(uuid "4a1d076b-521b-4c15-b15f-e09b3534bad1")
	)
	(text "U1 plugs into a 9-pin relay socket (or the ICS-102300 IP65 socket) \nand connects to J6 by a short pigtail. J6 pinout is unchanged.\nBus 2 (rocket side): CAN_ext+/- and GND_EXT come from the rocket through J2 and J6.\n  GND_EXT is the ROCKET ground (tied to GND on the inner board). Never connect it to GSE ground.\n  LR2 open: the rocket segment is already terminated on the inner board (fixed 120 Ohm).\n  Umbilical + pigtail is an unterminated stub: keep it short (<= 0.3 m at 1 Mbit/s).\nBus 1 (GSE side): LR1 shorted to L1 = 120 Ohm on. Terminate the far GSE end with 120 Ohm too.\nKL30 / KL31 (GND1): 9-30 V supply from the GSE, < 30 mA. +V_EXT (J2.1 / J6.4) is now a spare.\nPart#: ICS-104984 is the 1 MOhm variant (10k / 56k / 1M between GND1 and GND2?) - confirm with Würth."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 96.52 45.72 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "183ffca1-5831-4bb1-a725-c926de6e7e8d")
	)
